# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AICE2005 — student distribution repo
#
# This repository publishes ONLY the built lecture outputs and the knowledge
# base. All authoring source (Markdown slides, theme CSS, Python build tools,
# Makefile, curriculum YAML, notes) is kept local and never pushed here.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the repo root, then re-include the four
# published folders plus this file and the student README.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Ignore every top-level entry …
/*

# … except:
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/_knowledge/
!/html/
!/pdf/
!/public/

# Noise that can appear inside the published folders
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.obsidian/
html/.images.stamp
html/COMP.md
html/COMP-README.html
